            "reviewBody": "i was sceptical, but gave it a try and it was AMAZING! even my wife, who doesn't like beer or whiskey loved it! i adjusted the serving size doen to 2, as that calls for 1 can or bottle of beer. used 1/8 of a can of the frozen lemonade, next added the 4oz of whiskey, and finally the beer. stirred it up and enjoyed! i skipped the ice as the lemonade was enough to cool the drink.",
