              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Taylor Delehanty"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Tastes great and it's extremely versatile! First I made it with Ellie's Brown Ale and 7's whiskey, and that was pretty good, then I tried Shiner Bock Ruby Redbird and 7's and it was extremely tasty! Thanks for the great recipe!\nGreat for parties, and the servings in the recipe would serve maybe 7-12 people depending on how much people are wanting to drink.",
